@startuml UC-09: Manajemen Site (Lokasi Aquaponic)

title UC-09: Manajemen Site (Lokasi Aquaponic)\nSistem Smart Aquaponic

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C7BE5
    ActorBorderColor #2C7BE5
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    ActorBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    GroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
    GroupBorderColor #ADC8FF
}

actor       "Admin"                         as Admin
actor       "User"                          as User
boundary    "SiteManagementPage (UI)"       as UI
control     "SiteController"               as SC
control     "SiteDeviceController"         as SDC
entity      "Sites <<database>>"           as SiteDB
entity      "Devices <<database>>"         as DevDB
entity      "SiteDevices <<database>>"     as PivotDB
control     "MqttService"                  as MQTTS
boundary    "HiveMQ Cloud\n<<external>>"   as MQTT

== UC-09a: Admin Membuat Site Baru ==

Admin ->  UI  : GET /sites/create → Isi form site
activate UI
UI    ->  SC  : POST /sites {user_id, name, location, description, mac_address}
activate SC

SC    ->  SC  : Cek auth()->user()->role === 'admin' (abort 403 jika bukan admin)

SC    ->  SC  : validate({user_id: required|exists:users,\nname: required|string|max:255,\nlocation: required|string|max:255,\ndescription: nullable|string,\nmac_address: required|string|unique:sites})

alt Validasi Gagal
    SC   -->  UI  : redirect back()->withErrors()->withInput()
    UI   -->  Admin : Tampilkan error validasi (termasuk MAC address duplikat)
else Validasi Berhasil
    SC    ->  SiteDB : Site::create({user_id, name, location, description, mac_address})
    activate SiteDB
    SiteDB -->  SC  : Site tersimpan dengan master MAC address
    deactivate SiteDB
    SC   -->  UI  : redirect(route('sites.index'))->with('success', 'Site berhasil dibuat')
    UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, site muncul di daftar
end

deactivate SC
deactivate UI

== UC-09b: User Melihat Detail Site ==

User  ->  UI  : GET /sites/{site}
activate UI
UI    ->  SC  : show(site)
activate SC

SC    ->  SiteDB : site->load(['activeDevices.sensors.dataSensors' (latest),\n'activeDevices.actuators.logs' (latest),\n'notifications'])
activate SiteDB
SiteDB -->  SC  : Site lengkap dengan device, sensor, aktuator, notifikasi
deactivate SiteDB

SC   -->  UI  : view('user.sites.show', site)
deactivate SC
UI   -->  User : Tampilkan halaman detail site:\n(device aktif, sensor terkini, aktuator, notifikasi)
deactivate UI

== UC-09c: Admin Menambahkan Device ke Site ==

Admin ->  UI  : GET /sites/{site}/devices/create → Pilih device
activate UI
UI    ->  SDC : store(request, site)
activate SDC

SDC   ->  SDC : validate({device_id: required|exists:devices})

SDC   ->  PivotDB : SiteDevice::create({site_id, device_id, started_at: now(), ended_at: null})
activate PivotDB
PivotDB -->  SDC : Relasi site-device tersimpan (pivot table)
deactivate PivotDB

' Publish master sync ke MQTT
SDC   ->  MQTTS : MqttService::publishMasterSync(site)
activate MQTTS

MQTTS ->  SiteDB : site->devices()->wherePivot('ended_at', null)->get()
activate SiteDB
SiteDB -->  MQTTS : Daftar slave aktif pada site
deactivate SiteDB

MQTTS ->  MQTTS : Bangun payload:\n{master_mac: site.mac_address,\nsite_id: site.id,\nslaves: [{mac_address},...]}

MQTTS ->  MQTT  : POST Node.js /publish-master-sync\n→ mqtt.publish('aquaponic/master/{mac}', payload)
activate MQTT
MQTT  -->  MQTTS : Publish berhasil
deactivate MQTT
MQTTS -->  SDC  : true
deactivate MQTTS

SDC  -->  UI  : redirect()->with('success', 'Device berhasil ditambahkan ke site')
deactivate SDC
UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, device muncul di site
deactivate UI

== UC-09d: Admin Melepas Device dari Site ==

Admin ->  UI  : Klik "Lepas Device" dari site
activate UI
UI    ->  SDC : DELETE /sites/{site}/devices/{device}
activate SDC

SDC   ->  PivotDB : SiteDevice::where(site_id, device_id)\n->whereNull('ended_at')\n->update({ended_at: now()})
activate PivotDB
PivotDB -->  SDC : ended_at diisi (soft detach — riwayat tetap tersimpan)
deactivate PivotDB

' Update master sync
SDC   ->  MQTTS : MqttService::publishMasterSync(site)
activate MQTTS
MQTTS ->  MQTT  : Publish slave list terbaru ke master ESP32\n(device yang dilepas tidak ada lagi)
activate MQTT
MQTT  -->  MQTTS : Berhasil
deactivate MQTT
MQTTS -->  SDC  : true
deactivate MQTTS

SDC  -->  UI  : redirect()->with('success', 'Device berhasil dilepas dari site')
deactivate SDC
UI   -->  Admin : Flash sukses, device hilang dari daftar aktif site
deactivate UI

@enduml
